IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `rfo-corporation`

-- Redemptorist Fathers Ordinance 1948, ss 2-6 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_redemptorist-fathers-ordinance-1948.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a lease sealed before and signed by the Titular Superior` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `the office stands` IS `the office is filled`
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `the Titular Superior for the time being`
    `signed by` IS `the Titular Superior for the time being`

`a transfer sealed before and signed by the Superior's deposited attorney` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `the office stands` IS `the office is filled`
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `a deposited attorney of the Titular Superior`
    `signed by` IS `a deposited attorney of the Titular Superior`

`a mortgage sealed and signed by the Father Minister after the Superior's death` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `the office stands` IS `vacant by death of the holder`
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `the Reverend Father Minister acting`
    `signed by` IS `the Reverend Father Minister acting`

`a conveyance sealed and signed by the Father Minister after a recall` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `the office stands` IS `vacant for another reason`
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `the Reverend Father Minister acting`
    `signed by` IS `the Reverend Father Minister acting`

`a deed sealed before the Minister's deposited attorney and signed by the Minister in a vacancy` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `the office stands` IS `vacant by resignation of the holder`
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `a deposited attorney of the Father Minister`
    `signed by` IS `the Reverend Father Minister acting`

`a deed sealed and signed by the Father Minister while a Superior is in office` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `the office stands` IS `the office is filled`
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `the Reverend Father Minister acting`
    `signed by` IS `the Reverend Father Minister acting`

`a deed sealed before and signed by an undeposited attorney` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `the office stands` IS `the office is filled`
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `an attorney whose power of attorney is not deposited`
    `signed by` IS `an attorney whose power of attorney is not deposited`

`a deed sealed before another Father and signed by the Titular Superior` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `the office stands` IS `the office is filled`
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `another Redemptorist Father acting`
    `signed by` IS `the Titular Superior for the time being`

`a document signed by the Titular Superior but never sealed` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS FALSE
    `the office stands` IS `the office is filled`
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `the Titular Superior for the time being`
    `signed by` IS `the Titular Superior for the time being`

`a deed sealed before the Titular Superior but signed by nobody` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `the office stands` IS `the office is filled`
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `the Titular Superior for the time being`
    `signed by` IS `nobody`

`a deed sealed and signed by the late Superior's attorney after his death` MEANS Instrument WITH
    `is sealed with the Corporation seal` IS TRUE
    `the office stands` IS `vacant by death of the holder`
    `sealed in the presence of` IS `a deposited attorney of the Titular Superior`
    `signed by` IS `a deposited attorney of the Titular Superior`

§ `s 2(1), (3)`

#ASSERT `is the Corporation's office-holder` `the Titular Superior in office` `the office is filled`
#ASSERT NOT `is the Corporation's office-holder` `the Reverend Father Minister` `the office is filled`
#ASSERT `is the Corporation's office-holder` `the Reverend Father Minister` `vacant by resignation of the holder`
#ASSERT `is the Corporation's office-holder` `the Reverend Father Minister` `vacant by death of the holder`
#ASSERT NOT `is the Corporation's office-holder` `the Reverend Father Minister` `vacant for another reason`
#ASSERT NOT `is the Corporation's office-holder` `a successor appointed but not yet formally in office` `vacant by death of the holder`
#ASSERT NOT `is the Corporation's office-holder` `a former Titular Superior` `vacant by resignation of the holder`
#ASSERT NOT `is the Corporation's office-holder` `another Redemptorist Father` `vacant by death of the holder`

§ `ss 2(2), 3`

#ASSERT `the Ordinance empowers the Corporation to` `break, change or remake its corporate seal` FALSE
#ASSERT `the Ordinance empowers the Corporation to` `acquire, purchase or take property` FALSE
#ASSERT `the Ordinance empowers the Corporation to` `sell property` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the Ordinance empowers the Corporation to` `sell property` FALSE
#ASSERT `the Ordinance empowers the Corporation to` `exchange property` TRUE
#ASSERT `the Ordinance empowers the Corporation to` `mortgage property` TRUE
#ASSERT `the Ordinance empowers the Corporation to` `transfer or otherwise dispose of property` TRUE
#ASSERT `the Ordinance empowers the Corporation to` `sue in respect of its property` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the Ordinance empowers the Corporation to` `sue in respect of its property` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the Ordinance empowers the Corporation to` `sue or be sued on a matter not about its property` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the Ordinance empowers the Corporation to` `borrow money without security` TRUE

